Use placeholders → consistent output.
Example:
Mutation Summary
Gene: &lt;GENE&gt;
Variant: &lt;VARIANT&gt;
Impact: &lt;IMPACT&gt;
Evidence: &lt;QUOTES FROM ARTICLE&gt;

